# ─── n8n workflow templates (third-party reference data) ───────────────
# These 61 commercial n8n workflow templates (PUQ Docker, hdwLinkedin,
# SignalFx examples, etc.) were downloaded as reference material. They are
# not part of the MarketNow product, contain no code we depend on, and
# their embedded example credentials trigger false-positive gitleaks hits
# in the weekly L1.6 batch audit.
#
# To work with them locally, clone them into a SEPARATE repo or just drop
# the folder back in for development — it won't be tracked by git.
n8n-workflows/

# ─── Local operational notes — NEVER commit (security incident 2026-09-26) ──
# TOOLS.md / ESTADO_SISTEMA_ACTUAL.md / MEMORY.md are personal/agent local
# notes (credentials, infrastructure details, business strategy) that were
# accidentally committed to this public repository and had to be purged
# from git history. They must NEVER be re-committed. Keep them OUTSIDE the
# repo (e.g. in ~/.openclaw/ or an untracked private vault).
TOOLS.md
ESTADO_SISTEMA_ACTUAL.md
MEMORY.md
BOOTSTRAP.md
